2:T485,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover","headline":"Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover - A movie trailer Voice and a Hill Billy? That was the request. I said lets give it a go. I like how it turned out.","datePublished":"2016-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2016-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["Hill billy"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/hill-climb-racing-voiceover.jpg"}}6:["slug","hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover","d"]
0:["PTF5f6zbP51hXl6zOpnuH",[[["",{"children":[["slug","hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover\"}]}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>My Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover on part 2. They asked me for a movie trailer voice and a hill billy. I gave it a try and I think it turned out really nice. </p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main one-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the Hill Climb Racing 2 video</h2>\r\n<p>It's not often I'm asked to combine an <a href=\"/movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">epic movie trailer voice</a> with a hill biilly voice... But the unpredictability of this job is part of what I love so much about it! I hope they ask me back for trailer 3 too! <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\">Game trailers</a> are fun to do and I've done a lot more in recent years. Do check out some of my others on the link above! I love this genre of work because there is emphasis on fun right from the start and I get to work with some incredibly talented graphic and game designers.</p>"}}],false,false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/hill-climb-racing-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p><em>Newton Bill is Back! After journeying to where no ride has been before, Bill is ready to challenge the whole world in Hill Climb Racing multi player madness.</em> Hill Climb Racing 2 is the sequel to the most addictive and entertaining physics-based driving game ever! And it's free on <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hill-climb-racing-2/id1146465836\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hill Climb Racing 2 iOS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">iOS</a> and <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.fingersoft.hcr2&hl=en_GB\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hill Climb Racing 2 Google Play\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Play</a>! This game takes a lot from motocross and dirt-bike racing, inviting anyone with a smart phone to do some crazy jumps on a variety of vehicles whilst staying in one piece. It's impressive that a mobile game like this has an online-play feature. This game is a lot of fun and it was great fun to provide two different voices for the trailer.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you have a commercial in need of a voice? Maybe a voice like this Girafun Voiceover? Please get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage, and I can quote you more accurately. Send a short sample of the script and I'll send you a short audition. Check to see if my voice is right for your project. Please do get in touch today.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Hill Climb Racing 2 Voiceover","pageUrl":"hill-climb-racing-2-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","710",{"href":"/marvel-spiderman-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/marvel-spiderman-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Marvel Spiderman Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Marvel Spiderman Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","919",{"href":"/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice.jpg","alt":"Manchester City Football Commentator Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Manchester City Football Commentator"}]]}],["$","$L3","553",{"href":"/pig-goes-pop-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pig-goes-Pop-Voiceover.jpg","alt":"Pig goes Pop Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Pig g